=== RECOMMENDED THREE FRUIT-AND-VEGETABLE COMBINATIONS FOR JULY 2023 REPLENISHMENT ===

Combination 1: Summer Leafy Greens Bundle
Items: Yunnan Leaf Lettuce, Water Spinach, Sweet Potato Vine Tips
Rationale: All three have very high July seasonality (>1.7), strong positive correlations
  (Sweet Potato Vine Tips ~ Water Spinach r=0.65), and are the top-selling summer leafy greens.
  Yunnan Leaf Lettuce (#1 July volume at 2984 kg), Water Spinach (1402 kg), Sweet Potato Vine Tips (1404 kg)
  These summer vegetables naturally peak in July and are often purchased together.

Combination 2: Cauliflower-Pepper-Eggplant Variety Mix
Items: Broccoli, Purple Eggplant (2), Spiral chili pepper
Rationale: Broccoli (Cauliflower group) has strong July sales (2909 kg) and seasonality (1.22).
  Purple Eggplant (Eggplant group) has 1337 kg July volume with seasonality 1.09.
  Spiral chili pepper (Pepper Category) has 932 kg July volume with seasonality 1.17.
  These three items come from different categories, providing diversity and reducing replenishment risk.
  They are complementary (low negative correlations), offering balanced meal options.

Combination 3: Chinese Greens & Cauliflower Traditional Set
Items: Yunnan Romaine Lettuce, Shanghai Bok Choy, Green-stem Loose Cauliflower
Rationale: Yunnan Romaine Lettuce (1683 kg July, seasonality 1.44) and Shanghai Bok Choy (918 kg, 1.20)
  are highly correlated (r=0.62), indicating they are often sold together.
  Green-stem Loose Cauliflower (1224 kg, seasonality 1.05) complements from the Cauliflower group.
  These are traditional Chinese vegetable staples with reliable July demand.
  Shanghai Bok Choy has good margin (2.84 yuan/kg) and reasonable loss rate.
